{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Restore or clear MDC before swallowing inline cleanup failures.** With an inline executor, a nonfatal restoration failure reaches this catch after `result` is settled and is ignored, so the caller thread can continue with plugin MDC still attached or corrupted. Attempt a reliable `MDC.clear()` fallback, and propagate the cleanup failure if a clean state cannot be established.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QxeM","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":292,"observation_digest":"09199c4cec999d34ea71e2323c7932afb6b0959c5348fc65f5a47a1456d3adc2","observation_id":"aro_v1_bemzythmtgotj2tr4izdy6jsv6","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:21Z","review_id":"arr_v1_u5vqjkgdlfisimzhmtii6vlizn","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7adb5a65e5e91e736325ca7e73781e22bfcf8a7e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":289,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_yn2jfxlewv73iiyat7r6joisfl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:21Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
